Mock Battery Setup

To fake /battery_state (because this topic does not exist without physical turtlebot):
1. Move the battery_sim folder to the ros2_ws/src
2. colcon build
3. source install/local_setup.bash (or whatever the source command is)
4. ros2 run battery_sim battery_sim_publisher
5. Should repeatedly publish to /battery_state going from 100% to 0%. Just ^c and run the above command again to restart it.
